  "prefLabel": "En 407.01 Intercompany Cooperation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 407.01 Intercompany Cooperation. ELECs shall cooperate with all carriers to ensure an ubiquitous telephone network in New Hampshire capable of completing all calls, over which customers perceive no transition from one carrier to the next.\n\nSource. #14015, eff 7-1-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 400)",
